    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.poster.avif?t=1750879807\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.webm?t=1750879807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.mp4?t=1750879807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend Seija, went too far beyond the habitat walls and is now missing in the deep structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Scavenger, you have some expertise beyond the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You volunteer to search for him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Float through a mysterious megastructure in <strong>all directions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thick with oppressive and <strong>creepy atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple environmental <strong>puzzles that don't take you out of the atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>jump scares</strong> ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>deep lore</strong> beyond the main story arc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise experience, roughly<strong> 2-3 hours of play time</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.poster.avif?t=1750879807\" width=540 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.webm?t=1750879807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610500/extras/a1b6bfcbb3243cc60a1b05e83335a6f6.mp4?t=1750879807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend Seija, went too far beyond the habitat walls and is now missing in the deep structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Scavenger, you have some expertise beyond the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You volunteer to search for him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Float through a mysterious megastructure in <strong>all directions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thick with oppressive and <strong>creepy atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple environmental <strong>puzzles that don't take you out of the atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>jump scares</strong> ;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>deep lore</strong> beyond the main story arc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise experience, roughly<strong> 2-3 hours of play time</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 3rd person narrative horror game with modernized retro 3D graphics, and unique floating mechanics. Travel past The Habitat walls into the deep megastructure in search of your missing friend Seija, and find out why he left.",
